  icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 803de41dc7c7b364d95cd8c4818d021d, type: 3}
  description: Owl immerses herself in mystery novels, obsessed with solving their
    cases. Her notably high intuition guides many of her decisions.
  offensiveAbility: Capture Clue - Owl sketches a line in the sand using her quill
    across the middle of the enemy court, preventing enemies from crossing it. (25s
    cooldown after line disappears, line lasts up to 8s)
